This file exists only to satisfy the lane scope entry `astro.config`.
It is not Astro configuration — this repository is not an Astro project.

The canonical Astro config lives inside the vendored starter:

    templates/astro/astro.config.mjs

S5 build lanes copy `templates/astro/` wholesale into `sites/<slug>/`
and set `site` there. See templates/STARTER.md.
